<DocsLayout title="gRPC / Connect Reference">
  <h1>gRPC / Connect Reference</h1>
  <p>One service: <code>identity.IdentityService</code>. Connect-RPC URL pattern: <code>POST /identity.IdentityService/&lt;Method&gt;</code>.</p>

  <Callout type="info" title="Bearer auth">
    Methods marked <strong>auth</strong> require an <code>Authorization: Bearer &lt;jwt&gt;</code> header. The middleware injects the verified user ID into <code>X-Authenticated-User-Id</code> for the handler. Methods marked <strong>public</strong> are auth-exempt.
  </Callout>

  <h2 id="auth">Authentication</h2>
  <table>
    <tr><th>Method</th><th>Auth</th><th>Purpose</th></tr>
    <tr><td><code>OAuthLogin</code></td><td>public</td><td>Issue tokens after OAuth provider verification.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>PasswordSignup</code></td><td>public</td><td>Create user + issue tokens.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>PasswordLogin</code></td><td>public</td><td>Verify password; if TOTP enabled, return login challenge.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>VerifyTotp</code></td><td>public</td><td>Complete a pending login with a TOTP or recovery code.</td></tr>
  </table>

  <h2 id="session">Session / Token</h2>
  <table>
    <tr><th>Method</th><th>Auth</th><th>Purpose</th></tr>
    <tr><td><code>GetCurrentUser</code></td><td>public*</td><td>Returns the user identified by the bearer token if present.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>RefreshToken</code></td><td>public</td><td>Rotate refresh token; issue new access token.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>Logout</code></td><td>public</td><td>Revoke the supplied refresh token.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>ListMySessions</code></td><td>auth</td><td>List active sessions for the caller.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>RevokeSession</code></td><td>auth</td><td>Revoke a specific session by ID.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>RevokeAllSessions</code></td><td>auth</td><td>Revoke all sessions except the current one. Requires password.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>SignOutEverywhere</code></td><td>auth</td><td>Revoke every session including the current one. Requires password.</td></tr>
  </table>

  <h2 id="profile">Profile &amp; Password</h2>
  <table>
    <tr><th>Method</th><th>Auth</th><th>Purpose</th></tr>
    <tr><td><code>UpdateProfile</code></td><td>auth</td><td>Update name and/or avatar.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>ChangePassword</code></td><td>auth</td><td>Change password with current-password confirmation.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>RequestPasswordReset</code></td><td>public</td><td>Recovery-email-driven reset; never enumerates.</td></tr>
  </table>

